    {
      "padding": 0,
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "id": "markdown-6",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "Both renderers are tested against the same layout goldens…",
      "text": "Both renderers are tested against the same layout goldens as the web renderer. The Swift renderer has been run on iPhone and macOS and the Kotlin renderer on Pixel phone and tablet emulators; iPad, tvOS, visionOS and the oldest supported versions, iOS 16 and Android 7 (API 24), have not been tried yet. Their APIs may change before 1.0. The developer docs list what differs from the web renderer. Use a public API key in apps, never a private one.",
